Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.54,0:01:09.88,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,长大后想做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.40,0:01:12.14,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想·做·想做·什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.18,0:01:14.93,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想亲手尝试的事有很多！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.97,0:01:17.14,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,很・多・都・想・做！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.43,0:01:22.15,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,哭鼻子是不能解决问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.35,0:01:26.31,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,用心中的橡皮拭去眼泪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.10,0:01:31.47,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.90,0:01:31.07,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Metamorphose！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.23,0:01:35.70,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,为梦想而生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.56,0:01:34.93,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,One！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.19,0:01:35.59,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Two！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.96,0:01:36.76,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Four！Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.94,0:01:41.03,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,飞翔吧 努力的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.10,0:01:40.42,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.67,0:01:41.07,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Four！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.47,0:01:42.31,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Two！One！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.33,0:01:46.79,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,未来不是只论成败
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.12,0:01:50.21,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,描绘自己的明天吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.73,0:01:52.13,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.04,0:01:53.50,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,GoGo！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.10,0:01:56.04,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go Go Go Go！Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.46,0:01:55.01,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,转危为机 坚强地变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.64,0:01:59.02,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
