Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.76,0:02:01.26,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Everybody Yes, Huslte！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.43,0:02:04.02,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,心跳不已  喜笑颜开
