Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.12,0:22:37.58,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,今天也整日闪亮动人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.71,0:22:39.65,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,all right ！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.25,0:22:40.83,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,加油~
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.00,0:22:41.67,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,努力~
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.84,0:22:42.75,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,转换好心情~
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.75,0:22:43.71,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Ei~Ei~Oh！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.92,0:22:45.26,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
