Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.17,0:22:48.72,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Crash on！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.63,0:22:50.47,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,觉得惊讶
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.55,0:22:52.05,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,心想「怎么搞的!?」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.26,0:22:55.14,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,就算从逆境开始也OK！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.14,0:22:55.60,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,OK！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.60,0:22:57.48,OP＆ED,,100,0,20,,扭转乾坤吧 ！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.60,0:22:58.89,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,怀着！信！心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.06,0:23:02.73,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,打个哈欠 伸个懒腰
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.94,0:23:05.65,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Let's Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.95,0:23:05.65,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,舒服多了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.98,0:23:07.74,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,忧虑也好 疲倦也好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.90,0:23:09.36,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,能够让人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.36,0:23:10.99,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Fi~
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.24,0:23:13.03,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,ve~
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.57,0:23:11.16,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,重振精神的源泉是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.20,0:23:14.37,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,One Two Three Four Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.32,0:23:13.91,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,Powerful smiling{\b1\fs65} ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.91,0:23:17.75,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！Go！Go！Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.16,0:23:17.45,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,接着来跳努力平衡心情的舞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.54,0:23:21.25,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Precure5！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.67,0:23:21.00,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,借此把压力也 → 一扫而空
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.84,0:23:24.79,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！Go！Go！Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.00,0:23:24.37,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,大家都是闪耀的宝石
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.54,0:23:27.84,OP＆ED,,100,0,20,,闪烁着自己的生命之光～
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.42,0:23:30.22,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Oh~Yes~！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.22,0:23:31.84,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,追寻梦想的奇迹{\b1\fs65}☆
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.97,0:23:35.14,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,事事高升~
